    kind: invariant  # 3ebc
    title: "C: an ambiguous libc call's #include stamp omits quoted and transitive includes, so the ALL-expansion vouches for a real send() as an examined negative (NO-NET-SEND confirmed)"  # 3ebc
    status: violated  # 3ebc
    priority: 2  # 3ebc
    parent:  # 3ebc
    tags:  # 3ebc
